# With no structure in x the field is a half cosine between the walls and the index follows from the exact slab index.
# Reference: analytic slab index 1.743395, lowered by the lateral half cosine to 1.740701; agreement limited by the grid.
title 400 nm nitride film, TE, between distant walls
grid dx=0.1 dy=0.01
window width=8 ymin=-1.2 ymax=1.6
layer sin 0 0.4
symmetry even
field te
expect neff 1.740753831 2e-8
expect confinement 0.722887148 1e-6
expect guided no
expect cells 11200
expect neff 1.740701 1.5e-3
